{"id":"ec1809e41ec24c81","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md","title":"Closed Oriented Smooth Manifold","display":"df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold — Closed Oriented Smooth Manifold","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold","aliases":["58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold","Closed Oriented Smooth Manifold"],"display":"df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold — Closed Oriented Smooth Manifold","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold</span><span>Closed Oriented Smooth Manifold</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold — Closed Oriented Smooth Manifold"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md\">../batch05/58-df-atlas.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06b5f03f1e28a63b\" href=\"?note=06b5f03f1e28a63b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,d\\in V\">\\(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,d\\in V\\)</span> (carrier, topology, oriented smooth atlas, and dimension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Atlas}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Atlas}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold}\\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau,d)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\bigl(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(U\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\bigl((\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty(\\phi[U\\cap V],\\psi[U\\cap V])\\land\\forall x\\in U\\cap V\\;(\\det D(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})_{\\phi(x)}&gt;0)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold}\\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau,d)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\bigl(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(U\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\bigl((\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty(\\phi[U\\cap V],\\psi[U\\cap V])\\land\\forall x\\in U\\cap V\\;(\\det D(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})_{\\phi(x)}&gt;0)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Charts take values in open subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^d\">\\(\\mathbb R^d\\)</span>, so the predicate is boundaryless; compactness therefore gives the standard meaning of “closed manifold”.</li>\n<li>Positivity of every transition Jacobian makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> a chosen oriented atlas, rather than merely asserting that some orientation exists.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"06b5f03f1e28a63b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Atlas}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold}\\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau,d)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\bigl(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(U\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\bigl((\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty(\\phi[U\\cap V],\\psi[U\\cap V])\\land\\forall x\\in U\\cap V\\;(\\det D(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})_{\\phi(x)}>0)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false}],"bytes":1970,"backlinks":[{"id":"53d1e79be3c06aa5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1af83a707331071f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e4bf948cdb19013b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4a24e3f8bb40a4b5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S$ (ambient manifold predicate, see [[58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold.md|58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","d530952583f9f96d","06b5f03f1e28a63b"]}